    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "I get the social equity part, but it feels like those arguments are sometimes used to stall necessary progress. If we keep delaying these things because of \"social considerations,\" aren't we just prioritizing the convenience of car owners over the actual survival of the planet? Like, is it even a valid debate anymore if the environmental cost of inaction is so much higher?",
